            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention aims to provide an astatine solution that can be used in RI internal radiotherapy and the like for the treatment of thyroid gland disease and the like, and a production method thereof.The present invention provides a method for producing a solution containing &amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;211&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt;At&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt; (astatide ion) at a high radiochemical purity by using &amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;211&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt;At obtained by a nuclear reaction as a starting material, including a step of adding a reducing agent to a solution containing an impurity derived from &amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;211&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt;At; and a solution containing &amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;211&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt;At&amp;lt;sup&amp;gt;-&amp;lt;/sup&amp;gt; (astatide ion) at a radiochemical purity of not less than 30%.</p>
            </abstract>
